            "id": 6670038,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 恆生科技指數下跌-105.18點至3405.96點，跌幅3%",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間23日10:35，恆生科技指數下跌105.18點（或3%），暫報3405.96點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-7.92%</li><li>近 1 月：-7.45%</li><li>近 3 月：-26.33%</li><li>近 6 月：-27.9%</li><li>今年以來：-36.35%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>地產代理概念領跌-3.77%。其中    合富輝煌(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:00733:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/00733\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">00733-HK</a>)            下跌        9.64%            ;        易居企業控股(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:02048:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/02048\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">02048-HK</a>)            下跌        7.14%            ;        美聯集團(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01200:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01200\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01200-HK</a>)            下跌        4.29%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>汽車概念領跌-3.68%。其中    小鵬集團－Ｗ(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:09868:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/09868\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">09868-HK</a>)            下跌        9.89%            ;        中國環境資源(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:01130:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/01130\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">01130-HK</a>)            下跌        8.05%            ;        理想汽車－Ｗ(<a data-ga-click-item=\"HKS:02015:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/hkstock/quote/02015\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">02015-HK</a>)            下跌        7.38%    。</p></section></main>",
